    fea "你要一直穿着裤子吗？"
    scene bg black
    show fea18_7
    with dissolve
    y "不知道为什么，不以做爱为目的脱掉它，总觉得怪怪的。"
    scene bg black
    show fea18_6
    with dissolve
    fea "嗯？变态，别动歪脑筋。"
    scene bg black
    show fea18_7
    with dissolve
    y "全身光着的人是你——"
    scene bg black
    show fea18_6
    with dissolve
    fea "现在根本不是那个季节……"
    scene bg black
    show fea18_7
    with dissolve
    y "季节？对人类来说不一样。"
    scene bg black
    show fea18_6
    with dissolve
    fea "人类真奇怪……{w}连一支求偶舞都没有？"
